rst time\\nmakes me sorta anxious.","msg_0529_T11_00005":"Chomp... Chew...\\rThe manager of the Power Plant\\nused to be a repairman in a\\fsmall factory.\\rChew... Chew...\\rHis hard work has taken him up the\\nladder to eventually become the\\fmanager of the Power Plant.\\fChew... Gulp...\\rQuite impressive, don’t you think?\\nHaaah, I’m full!","msg_0529_T11_00006":"This is Silph Co., famous for\\nPokémon merchandise.\\rIn the past, Team Rocket wanted the\\ncompany because of that.","msg_0529_T11_00007":"There’s a place called Trainer House\\nin Viridian where Trainers gather from\\fall over the place.","msg_0529_T11_00008":"You came out from Johto?\\rYou can zip back home by hopping on\\nthe Magnet Train.","msg_0529_T11_00009":"Kanto-Johto Magnet Train Line\\nSaffron City Station","msg_0529_T11_00010":"Saffron City\\nShining Big City","msg_0529_T11_00011":"Everyone Is Welcome!\\nFighting Dojo","msg_0529_T11_00012":"Saffron City Pokémon Gym\\nLeader: Sabrina\\fThe Mistress of Psychic-Type Pokémon!","msg_0529_T11_00013":"Silph Co.\\nOffice Building","msg_0529_T11_00014":"Don’t Call Me Uncle Psychic!\\nMr. Psychic’s House"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T11_016 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T11_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_011":11,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_012":12,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_013":13,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_014":14,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_015":15,"_EV_scr_seq_T11_016":16,"obj_T11_gsboy1":0,"obj_T11_gsgirl2":1,"obj_T11_gswoman2":2,"obj_T11_gsbigman":3,"obj_T11_gsman1":4,"obj_T11_gsboy2":5,"obj_T11_gswoman1":6,"obj_T11_gsmiddleman1":7,"obj_T11_gsmiddleman1_2":8,"obj_T11_gsmiddleman1_3":9}}
